  "stdout": "test_actual_id_binding_requires_fsynced_canonical_ledger_exactly_once (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nNo guessed or duplicated identifier can produce the separate returned-ID binding. ... ok\ntest_actual_validator_composition_retains_separate_observations_and_zero_credit (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nThe narrowed collector calls existing strict validators and never the old file collector. ... ok\ntest_binding_keeps_null_plan_and_all_zero_claims (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nThe actual ID is separate immutable evidence and never changes the original plan. ... ok\ntest_boolean_preparation_schema_is_not_an_integer_version (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nEquivalent Python Boolean equality cannot substitute for the literal preparation schema. ... ok\ntest_changed_live_ledger_refuses_before_any_query (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA previously bound snapshot cannot replace the current canonical owned-ID check. ... ok\ntest_data_parent_alias_is_rejected_before_writing (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nPreparation cannot write through a campaign data-directory symlink. ... ok\ntest_detached_clean_source_and_approved_dependency_bytes_are_required (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA mutable branch or changed dependency cannot become the prepared helper closure. ... ok\ntest_foreign_uid_and_unowned_ledger_refuse_before_query (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nForeign identities and missing ownership evidence cannot reach a live scheduler request. ... ok\ntest_loaded_modules_must_all_come_from_the_exact_staged_directory (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA library imported from a mutable source root refuses before any scheduler command. ... ok\ntest_nonzero_passive_claim_is_rejected (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA wrong future library result cannot grant admission through the wrapper. ... ok\ntest_owned_query_scope_and_pipe_limits_are_enforced (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nOnly exact admitted query arguments are accepted and no full over-limit output is buffered. ... ok\ntest_owned_query_timeout_and_bad_encoding_are_not_accepted (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nAn incomplete query or invalid raw byte sequence cannot supply an accepted allocation row. ... ok\ntest_passive_failure_is_saved_before_refusal (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA returned unsupported passive observation remains intact with no success result. ... ok\ntest_staged_artifact_and_source_mutation_are_rejected (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA byte change in a staged file refuses execution even when the detached source stays clean. ... ok\ntest_standard_preparation_has_exact_three_sources_and_null_identity (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nOne immutable standard packet binds every loaded source before an identifier exists. ... ok\ntest_two_logical_processors_require_actual_two_thread_topology (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA two-processor charge is not silently called one physical core without actual node evidence. ... ok\ntest_wrong_requested_gpu_or_step_memory_preserves_failed_raw_allocation (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nA contradictory actual resource row refuses before the passive file reads. ... ok\ntest_wrong_step_memory_is_rejected_by_the_unchanged_validator (test_run_passive_installed_slurm_observation.PassiveWrapperTests)\nThe current job's two-GiB allocation cannot mask a larger observed numeric step. ... ok\n\n-----------------------------------------